      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 HNSW Graph Index: Fast sub-15ms cosine similarity vector retrieval.\n\u2022 SQLite Store: Holds full plain text documents and metadata for context injection.\n\u2022 Indexes 3,000+ verified all-India colleges with zero manual data entry.",
