      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\u2022 Calculates Score Margin = Student_Score - Cutoff_adj.\n\u2022 Safe (>=0% margin | >80% prob), Target (-1.5% to 0% | 45-75%), Dream (<-1.5% | 5-35%).",
