      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\u2022 Scans choices 1 to 20 sequentially; provisionally allots first choice clearing cutoff.\n\u2022 Simulates official rules: Choice #1 auto-freezes; Choices #2-20 allow Float / Betterment.\n\u2022 Completely eliminates the catastrophic 80% zero-allotment risk for candidates.",
      "fontSize": 13,
